<title>AUSTRIA: Libya calls for better OPEC quota observance.</title>
<headline>Libya calls for better OPEC quota observance.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Libyan oil minister Abdullah Salem al-Badri said on Monday that he hoped for better observance of output quotas by OPEC members.</p>
<p>&quot;We have to do something,&quot; he said in answer to reporters' questions on quota compliance.</p>
<p>Badri was speaking before meeting with acting UAE oil minister Rakad bin Salem bin Rakad, who arrived here on Sunday.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
